# File: pref.prf

#
# This file defines "default" actions of various kinds
#
# This file includes, if appropriate, various "sub-files"
#
# See "src/files.c" for more information.
#
# Keyset mappings take the form:
# A: action
# C: keyset : key
#
# There are 4 keysets (0, 1, 2, 3), representing the Sil and Angband-style
# command sets without and with the legacy hjkl command remaps.
#
# When you press the 'key', the underlying 'action' is triggered.
# Movement, wait, rest, and direct directional interact defaults are now loaded
# from structured keyboard bindings in sil_sdl.json instead of pref keymaps.


##### Force certain options #####

## # Option -- Default to original commands
## X:hjkl_movement

## # Option -- Default to roguelike commands
## Y:hjkl_movement


##### Sil Keyset Mappings #####


##### hjkl Movement Keyset Mappings #####

# The missing commands (control + rogue keys)
A:b
C:1:^B
A:l
C:1:^L
A:k
C:1:^K
A:u
C:1:^U
A:n
C:1:^N

A:L
C:1:W


##### Angband-like Keyset Mappings #####

# Examine
A:x
C:2:I

# Throw
A:t
C:2:v

# Throw (auto-target)
A:^t
C:2:^v

# Universal Use
A:u
C:2:U

# Remove
A:r
C:2:t

# Activate Staff
A:a
C:2:u

# Bash
A:b
C:2:B

# Forge
#A:^D
#C:2:m

# Sing
A:s
C:2:a

# Character Sheet
A:@
C:2:C

# Options
A:O
C:2:=

# Interact with a square
A:/
C:2:+

# Set Macros
A:$
C:2:@

# Repeat as '0' is handled internally

# Remove some now unneeded commands (by assigning them to the unused 'A')
A:A
C:2:x
A:A
C:2:r
A:A
C:2:b
A:A
C:2:Z
A:A
C:2:O
A:A
C:2:/
A:A
C:2:^t

##### Angband-like Keyset Mappings with hjkl movement #####

# The missing commands (control + rogue keys)
